# web-portal/ (Next.js/TypeScript)

Phạm vi: mọi file `.ts`/`.tsx` trong `web-portal/`.

## 📐 Naming (TypeScript)
| Loại | Convention | Ví dụ |
|------|-----------|-------|
| Class / interface / type | PascalCase | `DashboardPage`, `TeacherProfile` |
| File component | PascalCase | `DashboardPage.tsx`, `TeacherPanel.tsx` |
| File utility | camelCase | `apiClient.ts`, `formatDate.ts` |
| Variable / function | camelCase | `getDashboard`, `isLoading` |
| Constant | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `API_BASE_URL`, `GATEWAY_URL` |
| Boolean | prefix `is/has/should/can` | `isLoading`, `hasPermission` |

## ✅ MUST
- Next.js ≥ 14, TypeScript ≥ 5.0, `strict: true`
- React 18, Tailwind CSS v3
- shadcn/ui components + CSS variables
- ESLint + Prettier (`.prettierrc`)
- `zod` cho schema validation
- API client với error handling
- **API calls chỉ qua Gateway** (`http://gateway:8080/api/...`) — KHÔNG gọi trực tiếp service

## ❌ NEVER
- `any` type — dùng `unknown` + type guards
- `console.log` trong production
- Hardcoded secrets — dùng env variables
- `var` — dùng `const` / `let`
- Hardcode URL service trong API client — chỉ dùng Gateway URL

## 📁 Structure
```
web-portal/src/
├── app/              # App Router
├── components/       # React components
├── lib/
│   ├── api/          # ⭐ API client → Gateway (port 8080)
│   ├── utils/
│   └── hooks/
├── styles/
└── middleware.ts
```

### API Client Example ⭐

```typescript
// web-portal/src/lib/api/apiClient.ts

// ✅ ĐÚNG: Chỉ dùng Gateway URL
const GATEWAY_URL = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL || 'http://localhost:8080';

export async function fetchInterventions(token: string) {
  const response = await fetch(`${GATEWAY_URL}/api/bkt/interventions`, {
    headers: {
      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,
    },
  });
  return response.json();
}

// ❌ SAI: Không gọi trực tiếp service
const response = await fetch('http://localhost:3002/api/bkt/interventions');
```

